    "text": "(3) The moneys and property of the Corporationwhosesoever derived shall be applied solely towards thepromotion of the objects as setforth herein and no portionthereof shall be paid or transferred directly or indirectly byway of dividend, bonus or otherwise, to any member of theCorporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
