      529.73,
      401.9,
      589.43
    ],
    "text": "(2) The accounts of the Corporation shall be examinedand audited at least once in every year and the correctness ofthe income and expenditure account and the balance sheetshall be certified by the auditor or auditors appointed bythe Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
